msgid "`ollama show Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` - Show model information\n"
msgstr "`ollama show Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` - Zobrazí informace o modelu\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
